{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "product_id": "zukan",
  "global_invariants": [
    "検証対象source SHAとruntime identityを一致させる",
    "private・blocked・unknown・errorはpublic projectionでfail closed",
    "owner/member/role外のread/write/reviewを拒否する",
    "writeは失敗・再試行・二重送信を検証する",
    "AI候補と人/専門家確認を同一視しない",
    "public reuse permissionとexternal inference permissionを同一視しない",
    "既存data/visibility/consent/rightsを暗黙変更しない",
    "外部ライブcameraはsource/owner/embed可否/attribution/死活を確認し、別途権利なしにframe保存・抽出・AI解析しない",
    "desktop/mobileで主要Journeyの状態・導線・回復を実操作検証する"
  ],
