      "start→success transition",
      "failure/recovery branch",
      "privacy projection",
      "back/reload where relevant"
    ],
    "rule": "page load/screenshotだけをJourney PASSにしない。major Golden Journeyはdesktop/mobile双方、surfaceが明示的にsingle-viewportなら理由をRegistryへ残す。"
  },
